{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104693","id":2422485293,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6QZDEt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104693","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104693.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104693.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104693","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104693/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104693/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104693/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5c5b9847dac7c4e08f596954919f7f0b52c6223a","number":104693,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `LocalVector::push_back` for non-trivial objects","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I happened to stumble upon this discrepancy between how trivially constructible objects and non-trivially constructible objects were being constructed in `LocalVector::push_back`, where trivially constructible objects seemed to be using `std::move` (thus avoiding the redundant copy) and non-trivially constructible objects were not.\r\n\r\nIt seemed to be something that was missed as part of #100477, as mentioned by @Ivorforce [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100477#issuecomment-2755852311).\r\n\r\nSome quick for-loop profiling using this code with MSVC...\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nconstexpr int N = 100000;\r\nconstexpr int M = 8;\r\nLocalVector<Variant> vector;\r\nvector.reserve(N * M);\r\n\r\nVariant variants[M] = {\r\n\ttrue,\r\n\t42,\r\n\t42.0f,\r\n\tString(\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\"),\r\n\tVector3(),\r\n\tTransform2D(),\r\n\tTransform3D(),\r\n\tProjection()\r\n};\r\n\r\nauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\nfor (int i = 0; i < N; ++i) {\r\n\tfor (int j = 0; j < M; ++j) {\r\n\t\tvector.push_back(variants[j]);\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\nauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\nstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::nanoseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\n... yielded 15.48 ms without the change and 12.89 ms with the change, so roughly a 16% reduction for `Variant` specifically, but obviously depends greatly on what the object does in its copy constructor.\r\n\r\n(This also seems to be the only thing standing in the way of `LocalVector` being able to contain move-only types.)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-27T13:25:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T14:09:28Z","closed_at":"2025-03-28T13:39:43Z","merged_at":"2025-03-28T13:39:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"4a31936bc1af9c62efff8f7a93be1a2880ad260b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewe